<title>USA: J.C. Penney Co Inc Q1 net falls.</title>
<headline>J.C. Penney Co Inc Q1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>PLANO, Texas 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.53		    $0.57</p>
<p> Net			139,000		  142,000</p>
<p> Revs		   6,705,000		4,644,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1997 Q1 results include charges of $2 million from costs of drugstore acquisitions and $41 million to amortize goodwill and other intangle assets from those acquisitions.</p>
